OL,3,ASimon Jack: Is Poundland's US owner to
OL,4,Ablame for its collapse?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team running Poundland blame the
OL,7,Fowners for strangling their ability to
OL,8,Fturn the business around, saying that
OL,9,Ftheir access to Poundland's own cash
OL,10,Fwas restricted, leaving them unable to
OL,11,Ffully restock ahead of the crucial
OL,12,FChristmas period.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
